{"id":1010504,"chapter_id":1010504,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"傍晚，街角的咖啡小馆，女人放下咖啡杯刷起了终端。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"随手划动，匆匆掠过众多数据，再偶尔拨出几个指令，她的触角就能通过数个代理、诱饵，最终抵达目标。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"只半杯咖啡的功夫，官方防火墙仿佛纸糊一般被捅穿，随即整栋建筑的系统都被完全接管。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"她切换了几次监控摄像，终于抵达自己想看的画面。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"透过镜头，老人安静地睡在病床上，身边满是医疗器械——那既是维持她生命的工具，也可以成为结束一切的凶器。","style":3,"background":111,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"结束这一切的指令早已编辑好，只需要轻点一下手机屏幕，一切麻烦都能得到解决，一切真相都将被掩盖。","style":3,"background":111,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"她的手指悬在半空，这片刻的悬停还不足以判断主人是否心存犹豫。按键就被按下，指令发送。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"……结束了。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"她放下手机，抬眼，漫无目的地看着街上往来人群。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"【空场】1秒","style":18,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"午后阳光渐渐变作夕阳余晖，又是同样的血红色洒在她身上。街上的人渐渐少了起来。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"直到他们悄无声息的全部消失，连咖啡馆的服务生也不见踪迹。女人没有动作，难得盖上终端，只静静看着街头。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"当她手中凉了的咖啡终于见底时，另一个人来到她身边。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"？？？","content":"介意我坐这儿吗？请你一杯咖啡。","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"嗯，谢谢。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"怎么到我这儿来了？医院那边的情况如何？奶奶她还好吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"选项","options":["还是原来那样，放心吧"],"style":6,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504017,"trial_step":17,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"还是原来那样，放心吧","goto":18}]},{"step":18,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"毕竟那可是重要的证人，不能让任何人伤害她。在嫌疑人动手前，我已经得到了不少有趣的情报。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"说着，你将一叠纸质资料放上桌，移到她面前。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"摩尔没有打开，而是保持笑容看着你，柔和得像是老师等待学生自己为她讲解。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"布鲁斯先生他的确参与过对狄斯暗网的调查，时间在入夜106年到109年间。彼时他非常投入，带领攻坚小队取得了很多成果，结果是3名同事都遭受过暗网的死亡威胁。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"但作为技术核心骨干的布鲁斯却安然无恙。就这么持续到109年，赫尼奶奶查出精神方面的慢性疾病，布鲁斯夫妇便申请退居二线，回归家庭照顾老人。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"一年多过去了，到了110年，他没有参与任何调查行动，不对暗网势力造成任何威胁，针对调查人员的袭击也很久没再发生。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"偏偏在这个时候，布鲁斯先生遇袭去世了。用你的话说，他是被暗网势力杀死的，因为越了界。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我便去调查他到底越了什么“界”。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"你查出来了么？","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"选项","options":["没有实质的证据"],"style":6,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504027,"trial_step":27,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"没有实质的证据","goto":28}]},{"step":28,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"狄斯暗网的手段很高明，大概可记录的信息证据都被处理过。我只在走访中打听到一些模糊的说法。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"110年，布鲁斯在遇害前曾经急切地找过一些亲友同事，说自家孩子联系不上，怕她工作危险出了什么意外，还有人说……他等不及官方行动，要自己去找人。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"然后就再也没回来，那么我当然会猜想他在过程中发现了什么才会被灭口。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"还有呢？","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"摩尔微笑着看着你，等着你继续说下去。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"选项","options":["还有，关于你"],"style":6,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504033,"trial_step":33,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"还有，关于你","goto":34}]},{"step":34,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"接近这一家人是利用他们接近网安，照顾赫尼奶奶只是为了利用她做你善心的伪装。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"暗杀也好、救人也好，都只是你隐瞒暗网秘密的手段。你从一开始就是暗网的人吧？","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"她并没有回答，指腹静静描画着咖啡杯沿，过了一会儿，反问你。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"这些情报可不好找，你一定比任何人都怀疑我，带着巨大的决心，不找到我背叛的证据很难罢休。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"为什么呢？因为那些可爱蜘蛛们的谏言？还是那个小记者说强者才能做这种恶？还是因为极乐岛解决得太过顺利，你们怀疑我就是两面派？","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"我那么努力地掩饰，难道就只是徒劳么？","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"选项","options":["……不"],"style":6,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504040,"trial_step":40,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……不","goto":41}]},{"step":41,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我曾经真的想相信你。希望你是清白的，希望你身上的疑点最终都能被排除，希望我得到一个强力可靠的同伴。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"如果一切都是误会与怀疑就好了。布鲁斯夫妇的死只是巧合，你参与暗网行动的确出于正义的复仇，这4年来对赫尼奶奶的照顾发自真心。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你接受我的提案，希望奶奶能从噩梦中醒来，由你抚平她家庭破碎的创伤，做她新的亲人，让她晚年得以幸福。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我曾希望这个猜想才是正确的。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"呵呵……哈哈哈……","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"你看着她笑，笑得浑身颤抖，看她笑着擦去消除的眼泪。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"你太谦虚了，局长，只想选择一个正确答案。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"为什么不能二者皆是呢？","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"摩尔侧过身面对你，目光从大街上移开，落在你身上。残存的余晖仍旧映照着她暖人的容貌，你却觉得这张脸变得无比陌生。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"我从来都不在乎其他人，也不在乎自己。但布鲁斯一家不一样。我的确很感激他们。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"在我18岁生日的那天，我刚完成委托人派来的最困难最重要的任务。按以前的规矩，在那时闯入我家的那三个人就不该活下去了。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"但我还是放过了他们。我想他们也许急着救人，没看到屋里藏着什么。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"我想……也许我真的很想试试那个生日蛋糕的味道吧。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"可四年后呢？你还是动手了，背弃了那些爱你的人，背叛所有感情给了他们一刀。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"是呀，要是他们别越界，不要发现我真正的工作就好了……可惜。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"110年，四年前，议会大选……多重要的日子，狄斯暗网当然要行动。我接到很多任务，要给合作伙伴们提供支援，连加好几天班，忙得家都回不去。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"为了不让那一家人担心，我专门准备了理由，安排好网安中心的事务，隐藏好行踪，把服务器藏在外面认真工作。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"只可惜我的前辈、导师、“父母”，布鲁斯夫妇实在优秀，竟然真的找到了我。加班的时候我可没精力遮掩什么，一不小心，就让他看到了不该看到的东西。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"content":"就算预料过这样的答案，你的脊背也如结霜般渐渐冰冷。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"现在想来，真是遗憾。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"如果不是加班过度忘了时间，如果我能按时回来，他们就不会担心，不会妄想以为我招惹到什么暗网杀手。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"如果他们稍微愚钝点，技术退步些，别那么快追踪到我的位置，别成功破解我的终端……就不会看到不该看到的东西。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"如果他们能别这么在乎一个外人，别追出来，别那么拼命地刨根究底……我就不用动手了。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"如果……","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"摩尔的假设戛然而止。她重新看向你，笑里说不清多的是遗憾还是嘲讽。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"可惜每一个if/else中都走上了不那么好的分支，而我终归要为自己的委托人负责，不得不动手。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"唯一值得庆幸的是……奶奶她疯了，大概是不想面对现实，不想面对我这个杀害她全家的凶手。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"疯了最好……我会留下照顾她，我还保有自己唯一的“亲人”。要是她真遇上万分之一的可能苏醒了，我还得麻烦着动第三次手。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"要是你不来破坏这一切就好了，局长先生。","female_content":"要是你不来破坏这一切就好了，局长小姐。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_69","vo_trial_10504_1_69f"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"够了，别再提这家人的事，接下来回答我的问题。","style":2,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"选项","options":["你是暗网背后的操控者"],"style":6,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504071,"trial_step":71,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你是暗网背后的操控者","goto":72}]},{"step":72,"content":"她笑得更深了，微微低头镜片的反光盖住了眼神，开口，就像程序终于等到了正确指令。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"是，也是它的创造者。狄斯暗网是我颇为满意的工程，是我奖励自己独立生活的礼物，我用它完成了很多项目。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"选项","options":["你杀了所有发现真相的人"],"style":6,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504074,"trial_step":74,"course":3},{"step":75,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"是的。我乐意对我的委托人负责。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"选项","options":["你们利用暗网都做了什么？"],"style":6,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504076,"trial_step":76,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你们利用暗网都做了什么？","goto":77}]},{"step":77,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"我签了保密协议。但没关系，你很快会知道。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"选项","options":["你的委托人是谁？地底？"],"style":6,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504078,"trial_step":78,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你的委托人是谁？地底？","goto":79}]},{"step":79,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"保密。但放心，她迟早会来见你的。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"选项","options":["……你们到底是什么人"],"style":6,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504080,"trial_step":80,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……你们到底是什么人","goto":81}]},{"step":81,"content":"她看着你，眨了眨眼睛，突然笑了。","style":3,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"……噗，呵呵……好可爱的问题。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"抱歉抱歉，不该这样。明明是你解对了题，该给你奖励。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1005,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"咖啡厅的灯突然炸裂，你急忙起身跟她拉开距离，远处无数瞄准射线也指向摩尔身上。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"黑暗中你听到她的笑声，看她缓缓解开衣领，露出心口处红色的胎记般的纹路。","style":3,"background":4340,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"但那不是胎记……扭曲着、蠕动着，仿佛活的一般，竟像是一朵可怖又美艳的花。","style":3,"background":4340,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"content":"这一瞬间，你想起了什么。","style":3,"background":4340,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"很熟悉吧？在我的数据中，你应该已经见过这朵花了。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":4340,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"content":"那花就像能吞噬意识般，越是专注看着，越是深陷其中。视野蠕动起来，仿佛不存在的力量逐渐汇聚，凝聚到被种下花的“人类“身上。","style":3,"background":4340,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504091,"trial_step":91},{"step":90,"content":"摩尔微微笑着，身旁，那曾多次保护过你的光幕升起，却密布着锐利的光刺。这一次，它成了彻头彻尾的凶器。","style":3,"background":4340,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504092,"trial_step":92},{"step":91,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"我本可以有一万种理由让布鲁斯活下去，但他发现了这个……那就没办法了。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":4340,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504093,"trial_step":93},{"step":92,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"我可不能违背跟种花人的契约呢。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":4340,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504094,"trial_step":94},{"step":93,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"现在，该看的不该看的你也都看过了。最后的时间，还有什么想问的吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":4340,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504095,"trial_step":95},{"step":94,"speaker":"选项","options":["……没有了"],"style":6,"background":4340,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504096,"trial_step":96,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……没有了","goto":97}]},{"step":95,"content":"街道的拐角，穿着风衣与帽子的人一个个出现。很快，黑压压的人群便包围了咖啡馆。","style":3,"background":2015,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504097,"trial_step":97},{"step":96,"content":"第九机关、MBCC、FAC、特务、战士、禁闭者……很久没有这样大型的战斗，冲突一触即发。","style":3,"background":2015,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504098,"trial_step":98},{"step":97,"content":"所有人都清楚，站在你们对立面的不再是普通的禁闭者——那是绝无对话可能的敌人。","style":3,"background":2015,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504099,"trial_step":99},{"step":98,"speaker":"选项","options":["你说过自己的一部分在110年永远死去"],"style":6,"background":2015,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504100,"trial_step":100,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你说过自己的一部分在110年永远死去","goto":101}]},{"step":99,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"这演技好得让人恶心。","style":2,"background":2015,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504101,"trial_step":101},{"step":100,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"……","style":1,"background":2015,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504102,"trial_step":102},{"step":101,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"因为那是骗你的呀，小傻瓜。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2015,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504103,"trial_step":103},{"step":102,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"很高兴你一度相信过我的“人性”，哪怕半信半疑，也足够让我欣慰。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2015,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504104,"trial_step":104},{"step":103,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"毕竟在杀死那对善良夫妇的时候，连我都不相信自己有心。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2015,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504105,"trial_step":105},{"step":104,"content":"爆炸接踵而至，冲天的火光照亮了傍晚的城市。","style":3,"background":2015,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504106,"trial_step":106},{"step":105,"content":"你早已知晓，这场决战，从一开始注定无法避免。","style":3,"background":2015,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504107,"trial_step":107},{"step":106,"content":"█月█日 \nMBCC局长办公室","style":9,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504109,"trial_step":109},{"step":107,"content":"轰轰烈烈的暗网系列案件，就这样落下了帷幕。","style":14,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504110,"trial_step":110},{"step":108,"content":"根据现场残留的线索，第九机关等部门很快找到了暗网的总服务器所在地，并成功将之捣毁。","style":14,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504111,"trial_step":111},{"step":109,"content":"至于主犯禁闭者摩尔在战斗的爆炸中消失，未寻找到遗骸。但由于你们之间的枷锁联系消失，因此被认定为已经死亡。","style":14,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504112,"trial_step":112},{"step":110,"content":"摩尔的同事、疗养院的医护，以及在管理局与她接触过的人都变现出了不同程度的伤心和失落。","style":14,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504113,"trial_step":113},{"step":111,"content":"随着大选的临近，新城政坛进入了空前的活跃。多名议员在街头开展了竞选活动。","style":14,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504114,"trial_step":114},{"step":112,"content":"仅仅是几天的工夫，无论是媒体还是普通人，都已经对暗网失去了兴趣。","style":14,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504115,"trial_step":115},{"step":113,"content":"狄斯城本就是这样，没有人会去关心失去威胁和乐趣的东西。不管它曾对这座城市造成过多大的伤害，如今也只不过是档案中的几行冰冷文字。","style":14,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504116,"trial_step":116},{"step":114,"content":"【转场，进地底】","style":18,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504117,"trial_step":117},{"step":115,"speaker":"阴暗的声音","content":"摩尔暴露了。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_118"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504118,"trial_step":118},{"step":116,"speaker":"？？？","content":"是吗，那真是可惜。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_119"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504119,"trial_step":119},{"step":117,"speaker":"阴暗的声音","content":"没关系，她的任务已经完成，在她的掩护下，另外三线已经稳步行动。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_120"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504120,"trial_step":120},{"step":118,"speaker":"阴暗的声音","content":"四年前她莫名坚持留在地表，现在被断了后路，总算可以安心回来了。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504121,"trial_step":121},{"step":119,"speaker":"？？？","content":"那个枷锁呢？残次品对她施加了枷锁，不怕把狄斯人引过来么？","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504122,"trial_step":122},{"step":120,"speaker":"阴暗的声音","content":"不必担心，枷锁已经被███斩断。不过是那残次品的能力，当然比不过更高级别的力量。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504123,"trial_step":123},{"step":121,"speaker":"阴暗的声音","content":"地上人只会认为，暗网头子已经死了。面对追来的猎犬，扔点骨头才好摆脱不是么？","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_124"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504124,"trial_step":124},{"step":122,"speaker":"阴暗的声音","content":"那女人最喜欢用这招，就像她甩出那个没用的服务器喂饱追查者一样。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_125"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504125,"trial_step":125},{"step":123,"content":"【转场管理局】","style":18,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504126,"trial_step":126},{"step":124,"content":"电视上，有媒体找到了摩尔的父母，尝试挖掘更多新闻。但他们得到的却是你早已知晓的情报——摩尔的父母还活着，只不过早已重新组成了各自的家庭，似乎早已忘记了自己曾经有过那么一个女儿，近二十年来从未和她见过面。","style":3,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504127,"trial_step":127},{"step":125,"content":"面对诘问，他们不约而同地给出了同样冷漠而无用的回答。","style":3,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504128,"trial_step":128},{"step":126,"speaker":"摩尔的关系人","content":"我不了解她为什么会变成那样，和我无关，我不接受采访。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_129"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504129,"trial_step":129},{"step":127,"speaker":"摩尔的关系人","content":"还是说……有保险金可以拿？","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_130"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504130,"trial_step":130},{"step":128,"content":"【转场，进地底】","style":18,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504131,"trial_step":131},{"step":129,"speaker":"阴暗的声音","content":"呵呵呵，他们能满意就最好了。这不就是摩尔希望的吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504132,"trial_step":132},{"step":130,"speaker":"阴暗的声音","content":"暗网……不，暗潮的使命已经达成，数据化狂厄彻底成熟，物质层的硬件设备不再被需要，每一个接触过暗网的狄斯人都会成为新狂厄网的服务器。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_133"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504133,"trial_step":133},{"step":131,"speaker":"阴暗的声音","content":"就让狄斯人抱着那台残破的破烂庆功吧，我们的网络已经跨越天灾，触及全球。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_134"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504134,"trial_step":134},{"step":132,"speaker":"阴暗的声音","content":"路已经铺好，车轮将向前迈进，不可阻挡。接下来……","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504135,"trial_step":135},{"step":133,"speaker":"9th","content":"局长，您看上去有些焦虑，不庆祝胜利吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_137"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504137,"trial_step":137},{"step":134,"speaker":"9th","content":"难得追溯到暗网根源，断了一直以来的忧虑，幕后主使的枷锁也已经断了，不管还有什么不祥的预感，您也该在此刻放松一下。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504138,"trial_step":138},{"step":135,"speaker":"9th","content":"不然……接下来的大战，该怎么应对呢？","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_139"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504139,"trial_step":139},{"step":136,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你说得对，只不过……","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504140,"trial_step":140},{"step":137,"content":"你忽然想起，自己还有个地方没有去。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504141,"trial_step":141},{"step":138,"content":"【转场，进地底】","style":18,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504142,"trial_step":142},{"step":139,"content":"<i>终于结束了</i>","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_143"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":3,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504143,"trial_step":143},{"step":140,"content":"<i>我可以放假了</i>","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_144"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":3,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504144,"trial_step":144},{"step":141,"content":"<i>那接下来该去哪里呢？</i>","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_145"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":3,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504145,"trial_step":145},{"step":142,"content":"这么想着，眼前突然又浮现起那个人家，那片火海，被烧毁的车，盖上的白布，还有……","style":3,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504146,"trial_step":146},{"step":143,"speaker":"赫尼","content":"……你是谁……","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_147"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504147,"trial_step":147},{"step":144,"speaker":"赫尼","content":"……是你夺走了他们，对不对……","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_148"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504148,"trial_step":148},{"step":145,"speaker":"赫尼","content":"他们在哪儿？！！还回来！把我的孩子还回来！","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_149"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":953,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504149,"trial_step":149},{"step":146,"content":"【黑屏】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504150,"trial_step":150},{"step":147,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你说自己的一部分在110年永远死去，这演技……好得让人恶心。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504151,"trial_step":151},{"step":148,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"……呵呵，那当然是骗你的，傻瓜。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_153"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504153,"trial_step":153},{"step":149,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"眷恋、愧疚、或者说迟到的人性……那都不是我会有的东西。就像程序中不安分的一小行错误代码，被我姑息了那么多年，直到刚刚才终于彻底死去。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_154"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504154,"trial_step":154},{"step":150,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"谢谢你帮我排查这个小小的异常。那么……","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_155"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504155,"trial_step":155},{"step":151,"speaker":"摩尔","content":"下一次见面，可就没有温柔可言了，局长。","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_156"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504156,"trial_step":156},{"step":152,"content":"【医院】","style":18,"background":111,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504157,"trial_step":157},{"step":153,"content":"重新回到医院，你看到年迈的赫尼奶奶静静躺在病床上，关于手术是否进行，你们还没达成一致，也没有人可以替她做这个决定。","style":3,"background":111,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504158,"trial_step":158},{"step":154,"content":"而当初被截留的那条“杀人指令”……跟你想象的有些不同，也没有包含数据化狂厄。","style":3,"background":111,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504159,"trial_step":159},{"step":155,"content":"它甚至称不上指令，只是一句简单到不能更简单的留言：","style":3,"background":111,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504160,"trial_step":160},{"step":156,"content":"<size=44>做个好梦  奶奶</size>","voice":["vo_trial_10504_1_161"],"voice_bank":"vo_moore_trial","style":14,"background":111,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":110504161,"trial_step":161}]}